############################################################ # Section ############################################################ Section::Begin("");
BEGIN_PGML Which of the following are true? That is, which of the following pairs of numbers are related as we have defined above?
[_]{$relationChkBx}{5}
END_PGML
Section::End();
############################################################ # Section ############################################################ Section::Begin("");
BEGIN_PGML Which of the following statements are true about the [`\sim`] relation in this case?
[_]{$relationProps}{5}
END_PGML
Section::End();
